== 60x12
  +- Palette --------------------------------------------+
  | > tout chercher - c, r, a, d ou > pour restreindre   |
  +------------------------------------------------------+
  | > Connexions > prod                 prod.example.com |
  |   Connexions > staging           staging.example.com |
  |   Connexions > bastion           bastion.example.com |
  | ! Connexions > legacy                old.example.com |
  |   Connexions > emoji                 fun.example.com |
  |   v 21 de plus                                       |
  +------------------------------------------------------+
   up/down - enter - esc - tab - ctrl+e
   -> ssh -l deploy -- prod.example.com
